{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/20a8fc0f416fc88edd7ad7692746198b.avif?t=1772329622\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Encave</strong>, <strong>YOU</strong> are an employee of <strong>Encave Corporation</strong>, a cold and clinical biotech megacorp specializing in manufacturing bioweapons. Deep underground in a product-termination facility known as the Killroom 305, the player must <strong>destroy waves of rejected \u201cproducts\u201d</strong> \u2014 horrific, <strong>Lovecraft-inspired creatures</strong>. Players <strong>BUILD</strong> and <strong>UPGRADE</strong> a custom <strong>KILLROOM</strong> with <strong>TRAPS</strong>, <strong>MINES</strong>, <strong>TURRETS</strong>, <strong>WALLS</strong>, and <strong>BARRICADES</strong> to handle increasingly difficult waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encave is a hybrid FPS-tower-defense game where players build customizable killrooms to eliminate waves of corporate bioweapon rejects. With a fully destructible environment, strategic base construction, and escalating Lovecraftian threats, Encave delivers a unique blend of action, strategy, and dark humor for PC players on Steam.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These features are actively being developed, and we can\u2019t wait to share more updates soon!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3246990?t=1772329622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772329622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/7e08d3b10e13badecf53a392286c169abe5076f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772329622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/7e08d3b10e13badecf53a392286c169abe5076f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772329622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/20a8fc0f416fc88edd7ad7692746198b.avif?t=1772329622\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Encave</strong>, <strong>YOU</strong> are an employee of <strong>Encave Corporation</strong>, a cold and clinical biotech megacorp specializing in manufacturing bioweapons. Deep underground in a product-termination facility known as the Killroom 305, the player must <strong>destroy waves of rejected \u201cproducts\u201d</strong> \u2014 horrific, <strong>Lovecraft-inspired creatures</strong>. Players <strong>BUILD</strong> and <strong>UPGRADE</strong> a custom <strong>KILLROOM</strong> with <strong>TRAPS</strong>, <strong>MINES</strong>, <strong>TURRETS</strong>, <strong>WALLS</strong>, and <strong>BARRICADES</strong> to handle increasingly difficult waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encave is a hybrid FPS-tower-defense game where players build customizable killrooms to eliminate waves of corporate bioweapon rejects. With a fully destructible environment, strategic base construction, and escalating Lovecraftian threats, Encave delivers a unique blend of action, strategy, and dark humor for PC players on Steam.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These features are actively being developed, and we can\u2019t wait to share more updates soon!</strong></p>","developers":["Imagination Port"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/667490aa064922870333d16ca3b3db73efe09401/header.jpg?t=1772329622","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3246990/733829254/5502da483f64006cc1aaf9233489df73cd9bc7d8/1766064862/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766065694","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3246990/733829254/5502da483f64006cc1aaf9233489df73cd9bc7d8/1766064862/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766065694","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3246990/733829254/5502da483f64006cc1aaf9233489df73cd9bc7d8/1766064862/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766065694","id":257252122,"name":"ENCAVE - First Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257252122/7161f35258b0e1eb06f6c433ebae17df9e34dfca/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766065694"}],"name":"Encave","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 hardware CPU threads - Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5 750 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video card must be 1 GB or more<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><